% VERIFIED: full-text PDF read (Turku OA copy); all cited passages confirmed
%   verbatim (re-fetched 2026-07-17 for the right-value passage).
% DATE: 2026-07-17
% FOUND-VIA (here): reused from vt-prog-misconceptions, types.tex,
%   literature protocol app:litprotocol.  The entry and the provenance
%   block above are copied verbatim from that repository's
%   misconceptions.bib; the lines marked "(here)" are this deck's own.
% VERIFIED (here): the full text is NOT reachable from this environment.
%   The Turku open-access copy under www.utupub.fi/bitstream/10024/165245/
%   (the pdf_url OpenAlex gives for W2548490722) answers HTTP 403 to both
%   scholar's downloader and curl with a browser user agent, and the SAGE
%   version behind doi:10.1177/0047239515627263 is paywalled.  What WAS
%   read here, in full and verbatim, is the abstract as OpenAlex returns
